 "strings": {
  "Yagami-san, I got you something! I found it on the beach when Miharu-chan and I were on a trip.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I have a gift for you today. I picked it up when I went traveling with my boyfriend...": "",
  "Hehe, I'm glad you like it.": "",
  "Yo, Yagami-san. I got some extra extract ingredients left. I'll let you have one.": "",
  "Oh, thank you so much!": "",
  "Hmm... I don't care how expensive this cigarette was, I can't taste the difference.": "",
  "(That cigarette butt... For some reason, I feel like it might come in handy.)": "",
  "Yosuke-kun, if you're going to throw that away, could I have it instead?": "",
  "I actually need more of these, so let me know whenever you have any.": "",
  "You sure collect some weird stuff, Yagami-san. But okay.": "",
  "Yagami-san, do you want this cigarette butt?": "",
  "Yeah, I'll take it.": "",
  "Whew! Gold Viper's probably the only energy drink that actually has any effect on me.": "",
  "(That bottle could work in an extract.)": "",
  "Hey, if you don't need that bottle, could I have it?": "",
  "Huh? Sure.": "",
  "Why do you want something like this, though?": "",
  "Oh, it's kind of hard to explain...": "",
  "Wow, an extract, huh? That's pretty random.": "",
  "Seriously. But what I need can be found lying around on Pink Street, so can you give me anything you find?": "",
  "Sure, will do.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I stumbled across something you might want. Can you use this?": "",
  "Definitely. I'll take it. Let me know if you find anything else.": "",
  "Oh Yagami-san, check this out. This here's a real bullet.": "",
  "How dangerous... How'd you get this?": "",
  "One of the people I collect from lives in a dangerous area where you can find a whole bunch of 'em lying around.": "",
  "(A bullet, huh? For some reason... I get the feeling I should keep it.)": "",
  "Kamaguchi-san, you think you can give that to me? I kinda need it for something...": "",
  "Huh? Yeah, sure.": "",
  "Hopefully you don't find any more of these. But if you do, I kinda need them for something.": "",
  "Haha, you collect some pretty odd stuff, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I picked up another bullet. Here, take it.": "",
  "Oh, thank you so much.": "",
  "Hey, don't you feel some type of aura emanating from this stone?": "",
  "I don't really know what that is, man...": "",
  "(Oh, that stone might be a good extract ingredient.)": "",
  "Deguchi-san, if you don't mind, could you give me that stone? I'm collecting it for something.": "",
  "Huh? Sure, I just picked it up somewhere over there.": "",
  "Thanks. If you find more, could I have those too?": "",
  "Yeah, I'll provide as many stones as you need, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Yagami-san. I found this strange stone again, so I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Yagami-kun, I hope you've been keeping well. Thanks for helping out so often.": "",
  "Let me know the next time you're available to help!": "",
  "Eureka! You found me again! ♪": "",
  "I'm so happy you came, Yagami-san! Stay for as long as you like!": "",
  "Hey! You can't just barge in here!": "",
  "Yeah! Now get lost!": "",
  "S-Sorry.": "",
  "Hey there, Yagami-san. ": "",
  "Hey. You were Madoka-chan's senpai, right?": "",
  "Yeah, my name's Akko. Why don't we hang out together sometime?": "",
  "I'm Rinko. You wanna be my sugar daddy, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Maybe when you guys get into college and happen to be short on money.": "",
  "Ahaha, like that'll ever happen! I stopped using my brain a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>loooong</font_kind> time ago.": "",
  "Just come by and be one of our regulars, then. We'll hook you up with a nice discount.": "",
  "Hmm. I'll consider it.": "",
  "Oh, hi Yagami-san!": "",
  "Madoka-chan? I thought you quit already.": "",
  "I did, but one of the other girls got sick. So I'm temporarily filling in for her.": "",
  "That's very admirable of you. Especially since you didn't seem too fond of working here.": "",
  "Well, they all treat me well, so I'm just doing my part.": "",
  "Gotcha. How's college life?": "",
  "It's going good, thanks to you. I finally paid off my student loans and my grades have only been getting better.": "",
  "Good to hear. Maybe I'll see you around then?": "",
  "Sure!": "",
  "Huh? Why's this not opening...?": "",
  "Hey. You need to leave. Or did you have a key?": "",
  "A key for what?": "",
  "If you don't know, then beat it.": "",
  "(What could possibly be inside?)": "",
  "So do you have a key?": "",
  "(Is this the thing the girl at Apple Pie told me about?)": "",
  "Come on in.": "",
  "(Let's see if I can get this open.)": "",
  "So this is where people play professional mahjong.": "",
  "Oh, do we have ourselves a newcomer?": "",
  "Yeah, I managed to get a key somehow.": "",
  "I see. Talk to the guy at the mahjong table when you want to play at the high-stakes table.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you know about Lullaby, right? The mahjong parlor that's in the same building as us?": "",
  "Yeah. What about it?": "",
  "Apparently there's a \"special room\" in there.": "",
  "A special room?": "",
  "Yeah. I hear that's where all the pros go to play mahjong. Not that I would know.": "",
  "Huh... that actually sounds kinda fun.": "",
  "So I ended up getting this key from a customer. You want it?": "",
  "Oh, definitely! Thanks. I'll be sure to check it out.": "",
  "Yagami-san, listen to this. There was this famous politician who came to our place not too long ago.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Who was it?": "",
  "Miki, a former professional wrestler.": "",
  "Huh? Isn't that the guy who was all over the news...? Some kinda scandal or something?": "",
  "That's right! So get this. Miki actually came in here wearing dark sunglasses and a hat, but I recognized him right away?": "",
  "And would you believe he's a masochist? He wanted me to do some wrestling moves on him... Kinky, right?": "",
  "Huh. How about that.": "",
  "Wanna hear about the photo that started the whole scandal?": "",
  "...That's amazing! You actually beat Miki in a fight?": "",
  "Yup. Although he might have been rusty since he's been in politics for so long.": "",
  "You really saved my ass last time. Thanks to you, I finally got rid of the bounty the Keihin Gang put on my head.": "",
  "Oh, I'm so glad! Madoka was really worried about you, you know?": "",
  "I never expected Madoka-chan would be the one rescuing me.": "",
  "Yeah, she just happened to be at the club at the time. As soon as I told her your situation, she said we had to help.": "",
  "Tell her thank you for me, will you?": "",
  "(I know this girl... She's the one who came to me about the sexual harassment issue...)": "",
  "You know her, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yeah, I guess you could say that.": "",
  "W-W-What are <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> doing here!?": "",
  "Relax, I just happened to be here. You?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>I</font_kind> was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>fired</font_kind> because of you! So I'm looking for a new job!": "",
  "Okay. But why here?": "",
  "Hmph. Because I'm good at toying with men. As you are well aware.": "",
  "Ooh, did she toy with you too, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Ah—well. Yeah. I guess she did.": "",
  "I guess even you can't resist the comforting allure of a woman's soft chest.": "",
  "That's... not what happened.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. You're not here to fondle one of us up, are you?": "",
  "No way. I just wanted to kill some time.": "",
  "So detectives have a lot of time on their hands, huh?": "",
  "Haha, I won't deny that.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, tell me what you think. Did I put on too much makeup?": "",
  "Hmm. I wouldn't say that.": "",
  "*sigh* I must be getting old, then. My makeup hasn't been sitting well.": "",
  "Don't worry about it. The customers are only checking out your tits anyway.": "",
  "The customers might not notice, but you do, I'm sure?": "",
  "Don't worry about what I think.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. Is it true that all men get turned on by schoolgirls in uniform?": "",
  "Gee, I would hope not...": "",
  "A customer once told me that uniforms remind men of their youthful adolescent days... Back when they had their first love.": "",
  "He also said it triggers the feeling of having a raging boner all the time.": "",
  "Yagami-san, is that true?": "",
  "I honestly wouldn't know.": "",
  "It sure is cold today. It's worse because my tits are hanging out half the time.": "",
  "Oww... That pervert grabbed my boobs way too hard.": "",
  "That's nothing! I actually got bit one time.": "",
  "Oh. Yagami-san. Didn't see you there... Well, this is awkward.": "",
  "So this customer tells me my ass is too firm. Totally rude, right?": "",
  "Maybe because you've been going to the gym lately?": "",
  "Wasn't there a customer who was super obsessed with butts? I haven't seen him around lately.": "",
  "Oh yeah... That guy with the beard. Ugh, he was gross.": "",
  "So this total creeper came in a while back. He asked if he could sniff our panties.": "",
  "Yeah. He offered to pay for mine. I wonder what happened to him?": "",
  "Oh crap. I forgot to pluck my nipple hair out.": "",
  "It's fine. The club's super dark, so no one'll see a thing.": "",
  "Eww, what is this hair on me?": "",
  "Isn't it from the guy you were just with? It's all curly.": "",
  "But... that guy was bald.": "",
  "I don't think I want to know any more.": "",
  "I heard you coughing earlier. You don't have the flu, do you?": "",
  "What? No way.": "",
  "So, I was watching this really cheesy movie with my boyfriend yesterday. And he was totally crying his eyes out!": "",
  "It happens sometimes. Like, guys pretend to cry so they seem more emotional.": "",
  "*sniff sniff* Do I smell weird, Yagami-san? One of our customers was really stinky... Hope it didn't rub off on me.": "",
  "Yeah, that guy's B.O. nearly suffocated me.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. I saw you while I was walking, but I guess you didn't recognize me.": "",
  "Maybe it's cause I don't wear makeup when I'm off. Haha.": "",
  "What's up? Do you want me to show you to a good izakaya?": "",
  "Or maybe somewhere more \"adventurous\"?": "",
  "Ah. No. Never mind.": "",
  "(Barkers... they're all the same. Guess they thought I was a customer.)": "",
  "Oh, hey dude. How's life? How's work? How you doing with the ladies?": "",
  "Decent, decent, and... no comment. What about you?": "",
  "Mm, ever since Madonkadonk quit, I just haven't been feeling it...": "",
  "You lost your motivation, huh?": "",
  "I guess. I'm still making kickass pay, so of course I'm gonna keep working...": "",
  "But I'm looking for other jobs, too.": "",
  "I see. Well, I hope you find a good one.": "",
  "So there was this totally random guy who came by not too long ago.": "",
  "Aren't all your customers totally random guys?": "",
  "Yeah, but this guy was some fancypants from overseas. He even left me a tip after I took him to a good spot.": "",
  "Bam! Hit me with a hundred grand, just like that.": "",
  "That's pretty damn generous.": "",
  "Apparently there aren't any hostess clubs in his country. He seemed really happy when he left.": "",
  "I guess it's just a Japan thing.": "",
  "Listen to this, Yagami-san.": "",
  "This nutcase over here tried pulling in an undercover cop.": "",
  "Yeah, man. Bad times.": "",
  "Well, technically it is against the law to stop people on the street.": "",
  "Psh. With a silver tongue like mine, I could bring a cop to a hostess club <font_kind=yakuza_italic>anytime</font_kind>.": "",
  "I'm glad you're confident in yourself, but make sure you know what you're doing.": "",
  "That shit that went down with the Keihin Gang was pretty crazy, wasn't it?": "",
  "Yeah. I managed to survive, thanks to you guys.": "",
  "Heh, no sweat. Looked like you were in some real danger.": "",
  "A huge group of thugs came by after you left Theater Square.": "",
  "It's scary how much power money has.": "",
  "Well, I guess your way with people was even more powerful.": "",
  "And I'm truly thankful for it.": "",
  "Yagami-san, do you know if something happened to Tsukino?": "",
  "Huh!? ...What kind of something?": "",
  "I dunno, she's been acting all weird. She seems really giddy all of a sudden.": "",
  "O-Oh. Interesting.": "",
  "...Well, as her older brother, I suppose I'll just watch over her from a distance.": "",
  "(I'm sure he knows already...)": "",
  "Yagami-san. Do you know if something happened to Tsukino?": "",
  "She's been really depressed... even though she just got a full-time job.": "",
  "Would you happen to know anything about it?": "",
  "Nope. Not at all. Wonder what happened.": "",
  "Whatever it was, I'm sure she'll feel better in time.": "",
  "...Yeah. I'm sure she will.": "",
  "In fact, it's probably better that you rejected her straight up.": "",
  "Learning to love and let go was probably a good experience for her.": "",
  "(So he knew the whole time...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, you seem stressed. Like something's constantly on your mind. Maybe you should go somewhere to relax.": "",
  "Yeah, as soon as I have some money to burn.": "",
  "It's funny, isn't it. We end up with more than what we need, except for when it comes to money. And boobs, of course.": "",
  "That's just how life goes...": "",
  "Let me ask you something, Yagami-san. What exactly <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> boobs, anyway?": "",
  "What the hell are you talking about?": "",
  "So this old lady walks by, right? Well, her chest was exposed, so I totally couldn't help but look. Crazy, right?": "",
  "I sort of get it. Even though you didn't want to see them, your eyes still went that way.": "",
  "Correct. So what is it about boobs that makes us want them? Is it nature? Or perhaps some kind of mystical force?": "",
  "...Why don't you occupy your mind with something else for once?": "",
  "But I'm a barker, dude! Boobs are my bread and butter! So I need to do exactly the opposite!": "",
  "Whatever you say, man...": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. If you know anyone who wants to cop a feel on some females, send 'em my way. Just putting that out there.": "",
  "You're a barker, aren't you? Go find your own customers.": "",
  "Haha. Good point.": "",
  "Well, better get back to work.": "",
  "Man, it's been a cold winter. I noticed people aren't as interested in tits when it's freezing outside.": "",
  "I've tried talking to 30 people and no one even looked at me. I'm a little hurt deep down.": "",
  "That's nothing. I've talked to 50 people and they all brushed right past me.": "",
  "Ever been to Bar Tatsuo in the Champion District? I heard that place is a ripoff.": "",
  "So get this. My teacher from middle school ended up asking me for recommendations without even realizing who I was.": "",
  "And you know what? He straight up asked me for a spot where they dress up as schoolgirls! I nearly laughed my ass off!": "",
  "Dude, so this guy who was totally underage asks me to take him to a titty bar, right? Like, it's obvious he was a kid.": "",
  "He said he was in college, but judging from his appearance and his accent, he was probably a middle-schooler on a field trip!": "",
  "Um. Hello?": "",
  "Hey, don't just barge in here like that.": "",
  "(Not sure what I was expecting.)": "",
  "Oh? You're Yagami, aren't you? The guy who helped our CEO.": "",
  "Yeah, I worked with Kamaguchi-san.": "",
  "That would mean you're the one who lured out all the Keihin leaders and beat the living daylights out of 'em!": "",
  "Wow! You must be pretty tough!": "",
  "Eh, not that much, actually...": "",
  "I've been wanting to speak with you, Yagami-san. Would you care to join me for some tea?": "",
  "(Somehow I ended up spending like half the day here.)": "",
  "Hey, Kamaguchi-san. Your face tells me something crazy went down.": "",
  "Yeah. Some of our clients disappeared with the money they borrowed. Took off in the middle of the night.": "",
  "Just like that, huh? I guess there really are people like that. And you don't know where they are?": "",
  "Nope. But I doubt they went too far.": "",
  "Their car's still parked where it usually is, and my boys surrounded their place, so I know they didn't use the train.": "",
  "Could they have called for a cab?": "",
  "I asked the local taxi drivers but they said they haven't taken anyone that matched their description.": "",
  "You sure they didn't escape under the cover of darkness?": "",
  "Unlikely. I asked my clients living in the apartment across the street to install security cameras, and nothing came up.": "",
  "Yet somehow they managed to poof right out of existence...": "",
  "Yeah, well. I reckon it's only a matter of time before they slip up and show themselves.": "",
  "(This is getting interesting. I'll definitely keep an eye on this situation, but for now I should probably leave it alone.)": "",
  "Hey, Kamaguchi-san. Did you end up finding those runaways?": "",
  "I did. Didn't take me long, either.": "",
  "Where were they?": "",
  "Same place we lost track of 'em. Inside their apartment building.": "",
  "Whoa, how does that work?": ""
 },
